[1079.078, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ Meanwhile I'll do the polish work in the game code: smooth movement, sound, a win overlay, and door and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  plate drawing.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
